###
# --- POST /api/v1/test-security (requer products:write) ---
### Create Product
POST {{host}}/api/v1/test-security
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "name": "Notebook X11",
  "brand": "Deep Diver",
  "description": "A Gamer Notebook",
  "regularPrice": 1500.00,
  "salePrice": 1000.00,
  "enabled": true,
  "categoryId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"
}

###
# --- GET /api/v1/test-security/{productId} (requer products:read) ---
### Find Product By Id
GET {{host}}/api/v1/test-security/{{productId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

